      "text": "The Department of Purchase shall accept no requisitions encumbering appropriations after June 30, 1975, and for purposes of efficient operation may set a date earlier in that month. Agencies shall place neither orders chargeable to, nor further encumbrances on, annual requirement contracts issued for the fiscal year 1974-1975 after June 30, 1975.",
